    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4060de3d7d57e522c8539185",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我还以为，这是，额外福利呢。\n呵呵，对不起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "819f8e8e02056597441551bb564ce911dc28fbed455b764ba8adf03f083e0bf9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14355871f7fc84a833323b94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（我一定……会让她赢！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "32e6da06d2c2c8c3995ebd0c5f3b17636511e4012b5c3656a81fc99d5d822a64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67ffad7a5d6bcde714f096d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，现在……\n我，一刻不停地埋头做菜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "393191e2d9261c999e16e8528552878c7266d8a9ff0b4127bd8c2088bab04637",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1e23894bc8fd821b0b03146",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次比赛最大的关键，在于『做什么』\n……也就是『菜单选择』。\n这会极大地左右胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b90297961e2d1153f0fca87041ac95d8dac256749e844c601117ae8bd0412eb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d977b92c3b44d237d0db183",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许是考虑到准备起来太费工夫，\n规则规定，只能准备『同一道菜，共10公斤』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf0f10f3eacac5c6b6a9a3979569b22408a4442a3903e996e8e597453197c83b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80dc1ee84f35349ea9361c75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（我要准备的这一道菜是……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7906d78b9428ce16113f2dfc83801ae387f87bfe42d44dff2aa72a51dd7044d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21681ad98b3513fc70ae4b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（我要准备的这一道菜是……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7906d78b9428ce16113f2dfc83801ae387f87bfe42d44dff2aa72a51dd7044d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
