    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e40221d71684ef9c5c6ba16a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是准备担当赛马娘最喜欢的食物？\n还是考虑到『速食』的特点来设计菜单？\n每个人的方针都不尽相同――",
      "source_fingerprint": "5936b1d76cab74dd1d3454021b9200c0a8530d6288d43f15b775082b01501f60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8f0541fa83081b8fd1c237e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "负责实况的赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f6f7a15a2c76715fddb46fc1b5046dc66a670e079bf8227adca8db28d8b9f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f8b21cd9dd7868cbf4f6d61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『羁绊速食大赛』！马上开始，\n究竟哪一组能够漂亮取胜呢～～～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a8347830ff8efd25d7fe6e25b280faf9347b9890f06e1285fa29109638ceb25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
