      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼前的操作台上堆着小山般的食材，\n全都是为了接下来要开始的烹饪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7edec59f70488ecfb51de9898b429fe48d3959469d252a35ae2f3e274e37d81c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
